Umbervale Hold is an old keep of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]], on the same peninsula as the [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Kerneyy Prison Outpost|Kerneyy Prison Outpost]]. It is the seat of the [[Org/Althane/Oreskalka Cabal|Oreskalka Cabal]] and is built over the primary mine that leads to the body of [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]].

[[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] trained at the hold as a vampire and left with his sire. By his account the first vampire came from it: a cruel master at the hold made a slave eat what was kept there, and the slave rose with vampiric powers and began Lev's cabal. The ways into the mines beneath the hold belong either to the cabal or to the Oreskian government.
